---
import problem from '../content/sections/problem.json';
import solution from '../content/sections/solution.json';
---
<section id="problem" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="text-eyebrow">{problem.eyebrow}</span>
      <h2 class="text-h2">{problem.title}</h2>
      <p>Статичные диаграммы и фрагментация софта замедляют команды. Polygram превращает визуальную карту в живую систему.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="vs-grid">
      <div class="vs-half problem">
        <span class="vs-eyebrow">{problem.eyebrow}</span>
        <h3 class="text-h3">Статичность и фрагментация</h3>
        {problem.items.map((item) => <p class="text-body">{item}</p>)}
      </div>
      <div class="vs-half solution">
        <span class="vs-eyebrow">{solution.eyebrow}</span>
        <h3 class="text-h3">{solution.title}</h3>
        {solution.items.map((item) => <p class="text-body">{item}</p>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
